ains down around them. \n<br><br>\n(Source: Berlinale)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 11}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 15, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 205284, "title": {"romaji": "Mijime na Kiseki", "english": "Misérable Miracle"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Directed by Japanese filmmaker Ryo Orikasa, the animated short Miserable Miracle was inspired by Henri Michaux’s book of poetry and drawings of the same name, about his experiences with mescaline. The film explores the limits of language and perception, creating connections between sound, meaning, shapes and movement. \n<br><br>\n(Source: NFB)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 9}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 9}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 8, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 205287, "title": {"romaji": "Vision", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Eyes are magical spheres that make up dreams and retain memories. In our eyes, the visions of the within and of the beyond overlap. New worlds come to be when our gazes meet.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 7, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Achromatic", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 205794, "title": {"romaji": "BREACH", "english": "BREACH"}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "Promotional video directed by Joe Yoshizaki for the debut of HololiveEN's group of vtubers known as Advent.", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 7}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#holoAdvent", "genres": ["Fantasy", "Mystery"], "tags": [{"name": "VTuber", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 206146, "title": {"romaji": "Zhongguo Jingqi Xiansheng (2023)", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 11}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 69, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Supernatural"], "tags": []}, {"id": 206158, "title": {"romaji": "Balala Xiao Mo Xian: Xing Yuan Die Qi 1", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The Fairies Xia Letong, Yan Keke and Bai Yinyue, along with their Transfer Elf partners Buding, Milu and Lubi awaken the Garden of Spirit Spring, Island of Fantastical Summer and Park of Warm Autumn which contains the energy of the four seasons. Taking up the role of guardians, they must maintain the balance of the four seasons.<br><br>\nHowever, Siqi, the guardian of the Cliffs of Frigid Winter was deceived, and now intends to freeze over the other three seasons, to restore the order of Frigid Winter.\n<br><br>\nWhile the fairies guard the four season, they experience all kinds of trouble. In the process, they must learn to accept themselves, tolerate others and look at problems more comprehensively. At the same time, they will deepen their bonds with one another. In the end, their courage and understanding will turn defeat into victory and resolve the winter crisis!", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 8}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 26, "duration": 13, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Mahou Shoujo"], "tags": [{"name": "Kids", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 206352, "title": {"romaji": "until i die", "english": "until i die"}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video directed by Youhei Kameyama for the 